  "description": "<p>In collaboration with Bear Archery, the revered Fred Bear camouflage pattern comes to life through Rothco&rsquo;s legendary outdoor apparel and gear, including our rugged Moisture Wicking T-Shirts. Each item in the Fred Bear Camouflage collection has been crafted using the iconic Fred Bear camo pattern. Advanced Moisture Wicking: Engineered with 100% performance polyester, the Fred Bear Camo Moisture Wicking T-Shirt wicks sweat and wetness away for optimum comfort. Featuring our rapid moisture control fabric, sweat is swiftly transferred to the top layer, allowing for a quick dry. This prevents sweat from soaking through these hunting shirts so that they won&rsquo;t stick to your skin while you are on the hunt. Built for Action and Adventure: These crewneck tees feature a double-needle stitched neck that enhances the bowhunting t-shirt&rsquo;s longevity for repeated wear. With a tag-less neck label, you are free to move around without any itches or scratches. Standard Fit: These camo t-shirts are standard fit, giving you the perfect amount of room and flexibility as you hunt. Their length should go past the waist, providing you with additional coverage. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Complete your bowhunting wardrobe with a matching pair of Fred Bear Camo Tactical BDU Pants and Fred Bear Camo BDU Shirt.</p>",
